+<h1>WoW Forever class hotfixes – November 10, 2026</h1>
+<p class="lede">Blizzard's first class tuning: Enhancement Shaman goes back to Strength and Windfury, Affliction's Wrack now speeds up your DoTs, and Hunter and Warlock pets change. Live in the US on Nov 10 and in Europe after the Nov 11 restart. Every number below is from Blizzard's hotfix notes; the talent calculator already shows the new values.</p>
+<p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="calculator.html?c=shaman">Shaman calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="calculator.html?c=warlock">Warlock calculator</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="calculator.html?c=hunter">Hunter calculator</a></p>
+<h2>What it means</h2><ul class="mean">
+<li><b>Enhancement Shaman:</b> Intellect gives much less Attack Power (Mental Dexterity 100% at 3/3 instead of 150%) and Stormstrike hits for less, less often. Strength and Attack Power gear now beat Intellect. Weapon imbues and totems also work together now, so Windfury Weapon and Windfury Totem both proc.</li>
+<li><b>Affliction Warlock:</b> Wrack hits 30% softer but makes your Corruption, Siphon Life and Bane of Agony tick twice as fast while you channel. Put all three up first, then Wrack. Soul Siphon only counts those three DoTs now.</li>
+<li><b>Hunter:</b> pets keep 115% of normal health (they had 150%). Arcane Shot and Summon Hawk cost 11% of base mana at every rank, and the Hawk hits about 80% harder.</li>
+<li><b>Warlock pets:</b> Imp, Voidwalker, Incubus and Succubus have about 15% more health, and the Imp's first 4 Firebolt ranks hit harder.</li></ul>
+<h2><span class="tg c-shaman" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Shaman</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Stormstrike (Enhancement)</b></td><td class="old">150% weapon damage, 6 sec cooldown</td><td>100% weapon damage, 8 sec cooldown</td></tr><tr><td><b>Mental Dexterity (Enhancement)</b></td><td class="old">Intellect → Attack Power 50 / 100 / 150%</td><td>33 / 66 / 100%</td></tr><tr><td><b>Maelstrom Weapon (Enhancement)</b></td><td class="old">4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 20% per stack, 20 procs per minute at every rank</td><td>20% per stack at every rank, 6 / 7 / 8 / 9 / 10 procs per minute (adjusted for main-hand speed)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Weapon imbues and weapon totems</b></td><td class="old">Didn't work together</td><td>Work together (Windfury Weapon + Windfury Totem both proc)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Maelstrom Weapon</b></td><td class="old">–</td><td>Can be tracked in the Cooldown Manager</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-warlock" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Warlock</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Wrack (Affliction)</b></td><td class="old">Full damage; your Shadow DoTs on the target deal 10% more</td><td>30% less damage; lasts 6 sec, ticks every second; while channeling, Corruption, Siphon Life and Bane of Agony tick 100% faster (same duration)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Soul Siphon (Affliction)</b></td><td class="old">Counted any of your Affliction effects</td><td>4 / 8 / 12% per Corruption, Siphon Life or Bane of Agony on the target, max +36%</td></tr><tr><td><b>Imp</b></td><td class="old">–</td><td>About 15% more health; first 4 Firebolt ranks hit harder</td></tr><tr><td><b>Voidwalker, Incubus, Succubus</b></td><td class="old">–</td><td>About 15% more health</td></tr><tr><td><b>Bane of Havoc (Destruction)</b></td><td class="old">No global cooldown</td><td>Triggers the global cooldown</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-hunter" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Hunter</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Pet health</b></td><td class="old">150% of normal</td><td>115% of normal</td></tr><tr><td><b>Arcane Shot</b></td><td class="old">Mana cost by rank</td><td>11% of base mana at every rank (about the same at 6 and 60, a bit cheaper in between)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Summon Hawk (Beast Mastery)</b></td><td class="old">Mana cost by rank</td><td>11% of base mana at every rank; Hawk melee damage about 80% higher</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-druid" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Druid</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Nature's Swiftness (Restoration)</b></td><td class="old">Not usable on Wild Growth</td><td>Also makes Wild Growth instant</td></tr><tr><td><b>Omen of Clarity</b></td><td class="old">Could stop working after a spec swap</td><td>Fixed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-warrior" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Warrior</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Sweeping Strikes (Arms)</b></td><td class="old">Lost charges with no second target</td><td>Only uses a charge when a second enemy is hit</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-priest" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Priest</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Revelation enchant</b></td><td class="old">Triggered from Vampiric Embrace healing</td><td>Fixed</td></tr><tr><td><b>Holy Nova (Holy)</b></td><td class="old">Stayed learned after untalenting</td><td>Fixed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2><span class="tg c-paladin" style="font-size:15px;margin-right:10px">Paladin</span></h2><div class="tbl" style="display:block"><table class="races pt"><thead><tr><th>Change</th><th>Before</th><th>Now</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Redoubt</b></td><td class="old">–</td><td>Can be tracked in the Cooldown Manager</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
+<h2>Everything else</h2><p style="max-width:80ch;color:#d8cfbf">The same hotfixes lower the Auction House minimum deposit to 1 copper, add gold rewards to most quests from level 48, make racial vendor mounts Bind-on-Pickup, change Rage of the Storm to Strength with a 3.6 speed, and fix many quests, professions and spawns. <a href="https://www.bluetracker.gg/wow/topic/eu-en/639885-wow-forever-hotfixes-november-10-2026/" rel="noopener">Full Blizzard notes →</a></p>
+<p class="old" style="margin-top:20px">Talent builds that use these talents were re-checked: the Enhancement and Affliction builds keep their talents; the Affliction build notes now explain the new DoT-then-Wrack order. <a href="builds/">All builds →</a></p></div></div>
+<footer class="gut"><div class="wrap"><p><a href="https://ko-fi.com/bigdforever" rel="noopener">Support Talentsmith on Ko-fi</a> – it keeps new builds and calculators coming.</p>
+<p>Fan-made, not affiliated with Blizzard Entertainment. Builds and race picks are our own, made from the live WoW Forever talent trees.</p>
